# Pictures used for testing. Not part of the plugin.
#
# Four pictures ship and stay tracked: backwater.jpg paints the ground behind
# every look, and the three Custom slots are born as designed presets that name
# their own file (watersky.jpg, goldensky.jpg, nightsky.jpg). Anything else in
# here is a picture for trying things out, and is not committed.
desktop/assets/*
!desktop/assets/backwater.jpg
!desktop/assets/watersky.jpg
!desktop/assets/goldensky.jpg
!desktop/assets/nightsky.jpg

# Dev tooling. The two scripts are committed as an aid to whoever changes a
# preset palette or the look machinery; everything they generate is not, and
# neither is their one dependency.
dev/.work/
dev/node_modules/
dev/package-lock.json
